{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "85f371cae818ebf028694d9100bc7fe63ae96ff387668721cd3e7ffea2ee147f", "ja": "星の少ない夜だから", "zh": "因为是繁星寥落的夜晚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "022f90605c149f4a4992c9277406cbaa0c358ee1965e5854b0a3c4260521c56b", "ja": "プラネタリウムで流すナレーションの収録が\n終わり、まつりと美也は様子が変な海美に理\n由を問う。海美は、家族に会えない貴音に家\n族の話をしたのは無神経だったと落ち込んで\nいた。3人は貴音のためにできる事を考える。", "zh": "天文馆的旁白录音结束后，真理和美也询问了状态不对的海美原因。海美因觉得自己对无法与家人见面的贵音谈起家人的事太过迟钝而消沉不已。3人思考着能为贵音做些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8b35594e9d23ea01a1c8b99e26a21132c5513fd86d69b468de835cd3b9fa512a", "ja": "（今日はプラネタリウムのナレーション収録。\n最初は、ナレーション経験のある美也と貴音だ）", "zh": "（今天要录制天文馆的解说词。首先由有解说经验的美也和贵音负责）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "781bbd57364c2217742de16cd1c81b2504d20c0d8149caeddb5177db1b695abc", "ja": "『おおいぬ座のシリウスは、白く輝く一等星です。\n地球から見える、1番明るい星といわれています』", "zh": "『大犬座的天狼星，是闪耀着白光的一等星。\n据说是从地球上能看到的第1亮的星』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "f5a7fe338df6c5f8754cd96682e8989f748ed01c26954035bee8a3fd5ffa9872", "ja": "『オリオン座のベテルギウス、こいぬ座のプロキオン、\nシリウスを結んだ形を、冬の大三角形と呼びます……』", "zh": "『猎户座的参宿四、小犬座的南河三，\n与天狼星连成的形状，就叫作冬季大三角……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "24c8d92cd873e4c3d56820510f462ccc506d34b5e05192ca198077989e82ebb1", "ja": "素晴らしい語り口でしたよ、美也。\n私も、学ぶべき点が大いにありました。", "zh": "讲得真棒，美也。我也有很多值得学习的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "21ea8c07ad7d9ff932f29863ab1e784c7ee6db1563fecfe1fb6f27b34160028b", "ja": "ありがとうございます～！　前のお仕事を思い出して、\nがんばったかいがありましたよ～。むふふ。", "zh": "谢谢您～！想起了之前的工作，看来努力没有白费呢～。唔呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "95d1524a98870d02e3ee45aabca774f3bf86651691c221fa40c41b0cf6102de2", "ja": "うん、すっごく上手だった！\nでも、美也の声って……なんだか、眠くなるよね～。", "zh": "嗯，真的唱得特别好！\n不过，美也的声音……总让人有点想睡觉呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "e9320ab591741daa288d066ff8b6b0ca113edc7a24659ed584494edc93839ca1", "ja": "ふわぁ～……姫も、ねむねむなのです……。", "zh": "哈啊～……小公主也困困的了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "323d2b6678ebf550f140a2d706c9601a62c3944d8ac8fec305afad473e642c0f", "ja": "はい～、わかります～。\n私も、眠くなってきてしまいました……ふわぁ～。", "zh": "是～，我明白的～。\n我也开始犯困了……哈啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6de4f564a3bd784bfdb0644e3ed2cc773d2517d05587a73706b2c231cba6cf66", "ja": "待て待て。\n美也まで眠くなったらダメだろう……。", "zh": "等等。\n连美也也困起来可不行吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "781bbd57364c2217742de16cd1c81b2504d20c0d8149caeddb5177db1b695abc", "ja": "『おおいぬ座のシリウスは、白く輝く一等星です。\n地球から見える、1番明るい星といわれています』", "zh": "『大犬座的天狼星，是闪耀着白光的一等星。\n据说是从地球上能看到的第1亮的星』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "eaeacac36889807583155992e9fef3125afff9ff3a3a647a64e027dadfb7d451", "ja": "（同じく、経験者の貴音。落ち着いた声が心地いいと、\nスタッフさんにも好感触だ。そして、次はまつり……）", "zh": "（同样是经验丰富的贵音。她沉稳的声音听起来很舒服，工作人员也对她颇有好感。接下来是茉莉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "23eac87d4e38ab50578a0e93e81798df0d0d9a354acc26ab9de5c3d2127752ac", "ja": "『オリオン座のベテルギウス、こいぬ座のプロキオン、\nシリウスを結んだ形を、冬の大三角形と呼びます』", "zh": "『连接猎户座的参宿四、小犬座的南河三与\n天狼星而成的形状，被称为冬季大三角』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f3b19ba99535484d82d735162b4271574c327fed44b6a9b3ec4a5d7edb306b5e", "ja": "（静かな雰囲気の中にも、まつりらしい愛らしさが残る\nナレーションだった。よし、最後は海美の番だな）", "zh": "（这段旁白即使氛围很安静，也依然保留了属于茉莉的可爱感。好，最后轮到海美了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e9d1f1ea3b17c9c17d12346e889e85184b8fc6457282c5e4f3db0f0674469aaa", "ja": "（普段、明るくて元気な海美だから、\nいきなりは難しいかもしれないが……）", "zh": "（平时的海美总是开朗又有活力，所以突然要这样做，可能会有点困难……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "8406823b787e24ce46143d341fc8666dfc23a19da1b607c9206389b639bd9aa4", "ja": "『……冬の夜空を見てみましょう。\nオリオン座の左斜め下に輝く星、それがシリウスです』", "zh": "“……让我们抬头看看冬日的夜空吧。\n在猎户座左下方闪耀的恒星，就是天狼星”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "69463d366f2294e7bffee049d2332d3d77c670bb542810d1986ae6eb589b2310", "ja": "（おや？　最初から、結構上手くできてるな。\nでもその割に、表情が冴えないような……）", "zh": "（咦？一开始就做得挺不错的嘛。\n不过既然这样，表情却好像不太有精神……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "889aee5d8d39e5a4d4d828587c210bc5af9851863a2d89a31bd018e355726949", "ja": "海美ちゃん、お疲れさまなのです！\nとっても素敵なナレーションだったのですよ♪", "zh": "海美，辛苦了！\n刚才的旁白非常棒哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "1931d843180b122ab5ccee2d735c479bb71353b01f88a9867281f6183cf81713", "ja": "そ、そう……？　まつりん、ありがとね。\nえっと……あれ？　貴音さんは？", "zh": "是、是吗……？谢谢你，祭玲。\n那个……咦？贵音呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5182d10ddd04e4f5f94443900d90664d189e6bb9f17fd8ce0ba7815d44c6d5fa", "ja": "ああ、次の仕事が変更になって、向かったんだ。\n最後まで聞きたかったって、残念がってたよ。", "zh": "啊，下一份工作有变动，所以她先过去了。\n她还说想听到最后，觉得挺遗憾的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "e2e0eb9a953b3dbf89a751ae6e2d686bfce965e78ab18a4a9cdb4b9c712cb956", "ja": "あっ、そうなんだ……。", "zh": "啊，这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "578351414bb3ca801eb2c9bd77c745b41209bd613598f8302d21a357a867c97e", "ja": "なんだか、いつもの海美ちゃんらしくありませんね～。\nどうかしましたか～？", "zh": "总觉得，这不太像平时的海美呢～  \n怎么了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "5f450c8db637e4907f368166bcd1bb5743af0cb90432344b3d5ecec26adf4bed", "ja": "えっ。や、やだなー、そんなことないよ！\nうみみんチャージで、今日も元気100倍！って……。", "zh": "诶。才、才不是呢——，没那回事啦！什么“海美充电，今天也元气100倍！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "e9728bb6d59afd9bab3cb6118ab800ffd57f20ecf1b713210bc19db031a7546d", "ja": "海美ちゃん。姫たちの目はごまかせても、\nごまかせない人がいるのですよ？", "zh": "海美。就算能蒙混过姬们的眼睛，也有人是蒙混不过去的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "428543ad361158f500c02a0a13772dc7f1233ae08d70739864c7e344194d3d80", "ja": "ね？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "对吧？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "4004ef833c27f5f57aa28c81ad7470619cfcf4f164e17b7af7b623961397380a", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n俺にも、なんだか元気がないように見えるよ。", "zh": "嗯，确实呢。\n在我也看来，总觉得你没什么精神的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "7a54e820db8cd4b8b701a2a2bfbcf21b0d8d4a52799598d072535fe028c7de2b", "ja": "あ、あはは……。{$P$}や\nみんなには、なんでもわかっちゃうんだね。", "zh": "啊，啊哈哈……。{$P$}和大家，什么都能看出来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "6730c38fa4e43283bcdf33bb510811ad2b6daaa6a4ae769b9385d303cd345c85", "ja": "でも、大したことじゃないっていうか、\n私が落ち込むことじゃないかもしれないんだけど……。", "zh": "不过，也不是什么大不了的事，或者说……也许根本不值得我为此消沉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a64b91540e890a6a93ea1718a95372bfc8ece8f1f501f90937bcce32e3f25a35", "ja": "それなら、話してみた方がいいかもしれないぞ。\n頭の中が整理されるかもしれないし。", "zh": "那样的话，也许还是说出来比较好。\n说不定能理清思绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "8827e313c9fa5fbaadf6af157a2ad762124e981ce9ebf33c38587f3a3a135493", "ja": "う、うん。えっと……この前、貴音さんが\nアイドルになった理由を話してくれたでしょ。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。那个……之前贵音不是跟我说过，\n她成为偶像的理由嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "709a64c69dafcbd0f7f90a3f2c163dded2236f039d1501003024683373d1ea96", "ja": "私、何も知らなかったから……\n貴音さんのこと、傷つけちゃったかもって思って。", "zh": "我什么都不知道……\n所以我在想，是不是伤害了贵音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "a8ae96fd2ff9b4a96420d4521f69b8217e14e8ac50bd736baf3c9d5386f93c91", "ja": "だって、家族と離れてるのって、さみしいよね……？", "zh": "因为，和家人分开一定很寂寞吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "76c2a037a6048ecd2dc267f19521edb709a652b3a92c7817fa1e73523214fc55", "ja": "そうだな。でも、海美が傷つけるつもりで話したんじゃ\nないって事は、貴音もわかってると思うけど。", "zh": "是啊。不过，我觉得贵音应该也明白，海美并不是想要伤害她才那么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "cd3765d67746ea57cd849c07c302c655013d16802710830920ab8f801de360a2", "ja": "もちろん、寂しい気持ちはあるだろうけど……\nだからって、怒ったりはしないと思う。", "zh": "当然会感到寂寞吧……但我觉得她不会因此生气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "282a64d9667b21c0e74a72cd94785cacbc6ab2d1e8984ade3d624db40e0f51b7", "ja": "うん、私が勝手に気にしてるだけだから。\nでも、最近の貴音さん、ちょっとさみしそうに見えて。", "zh": "嗯，只是我自己在意而已。\n不过，最近的贵音小姐看起来好像有点寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "ccc41aaeab525e80003a706b4ff6101cc2302e92159bd6e6752e8047afb0fb2f", "ja": "だから、罪悪感があるんだ。\n私、ちょっと無神経だったなって……。", "zh": "所以，我才会觉得内疚。\n我之前有点太迟钝了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "132df0d64874a9dc900cf8bc046fb66854449b72da9bf35a34d2946aae3e4fb9", "ja": "海美……。", "zh": "海美……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "aff22d9e96dfc494b7f4f1261ebdd41d1669c26a405d67e98a693286611da7d7", "ja": "（貴音も海美も、頭ではわかってるんだろう。\nでも、寂しいのは事実で……というところか）", "zh": "（贵音和海美大概都明白这个道理吧。不过，感到寂寞也是事实……大概就是这么回事吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "f1ea3644efcc99e414127a356e40c44590933c4b238c58d938acb9b18579a151", "ja": "海美ちゃんは、優しいんですね～。", "zh": "海美很温柔呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "6f58e424b65472a697dbb1dcf19034d42c1d12116ca0c68beb2091c1f04c400f", "ja": "そんなことないよ！　だって私、\n自分のことしか考えてなかったんだし……。", "zh": "才不是那样！因为我当时只顾着自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "6ecfcaa4c2f94cc3a6d532446775d27cf8b7acb7e916258cbf25d76a59456da8", "ja": "貴音姫のことは、まつりも気になっていたのです。\n姫も、なんとかしてあげたいのです……。", "zh": "祭也一直很在意贵音公主。也想为公主做点什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "2ce0dba4a9cf0771e68943bfac6e3ab1b4bc0ba5530516c6d22929ca5017abc3", "ja": "さみしいかぁ……さみしい気持ちって、\nどうしたらなくなるんだろうね？", "zh": "寂寞啊……寂寞的感觉，要怎样才能消失呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "2735d7beb4b5755ecae79837506f69211a14b14077b0c57a674e90e397ed20a5", "ja": "それなら、お茶を飲みませんか～？　体がぽかぽか\n温かくなったら、きっと、さみしくなくなりますよ～。", "zh": "那么，要不要喝杯茶呀～？等身体暖乎乎的，\n一定就不会感到寂寞了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "177922500f9b2c79a3acb31e2e03bb02cd3bca2fb48499db061a120098939ce3", "ja": "お茶？　……あっ！？\n私、いいこと思いついたかも……！", "zh": "茶？……啊！？\n我好像想到一个好主意了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "cf641d243cad8b89aeba64f6e78578b0d688d99f9a1e89cf82b0ea395f8100d0", "ja": "美也、まつりん、{$P$}！\nお願い、みんなも力を貸してっ！", "zh": "美也、茉莉、小{$P$}！拜托了，大家也来帮帮我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "363892e50afea63925fdad35e4e13799683c83d815fb0c97e87abfa76659aa1b", "ja": "もちろんなのです！\n姫にできることなら、お手伝いするのですよ。", "zh": "当然可以！\n只要是公主能做到的事，我都会帮忙的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "267823b7ee2b330f5e77895f29f06745e6fd1484ce2509c7dcecdc210fb7581a", "ja": "私もです～。\nがんばりますよ～、むふふ。", "zh": "我也是～。\n我会加油的哦～，嘻嘻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "1f9ebacc55eb9a9c8b9f8abf37a987318e8b7442b2c6aed05a1bf98f20c21476", "ja": "（貴音が寂しくなくなるために、みんなで、か。\nしかし海美は、一体、何を思いついたんだろう？）", "zh": "（为了不让贵音感到寂寞，大家一起吗。可是海美到底想到了什么呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
